sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Agent
    participant Client as Client MCP
    participant Server as Serveur MCP
    participant Tool as Handler Tool

    Agent->>Client: Besoin d'une action
    Client->>Server: tools/list
    Server-->>Client: Tools disponibles
    Agent->>Client: Sélectionne lookup_order
    Client->>Server: tools/call lookup_order
    Server->>Server: Valide arguments
    Server->>Tool: Exécute handler
    Tool-->>Server: Résultat métier
    Server-->>Client: content + structuredContent
    Client-->>Agent: Observation
